WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:04.670 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:09.242
[ Old-fashioned music playing ]

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:15.648 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.385
-Ladies and gentlemen,
welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.452
Right now, I'm joined
by a lovely lady,

00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:23.323
an actress by the name
of Ms. Elizabeth Olsen.

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.690
[ Applause ]

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.292
-Evening, Jim.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.761
-How are you doing?
Are you comfortable?

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.628
I see they got you a water.

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:34.166
-Water? Well, that's an odd way
to pronounce rum punch.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:36.002
[ Audience laughs ]

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.171
-So you star in
a new picture called

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.372
"The Boxcar Gals and
the Fellas from Tulum."

00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:42.274
Tell me, was it hard?

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:45.011
-Oh, Jim, it was a hoot.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.013
-No, I mean
remembering the title.

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.881
[ Audience laughs ]
-Ohh.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:51.383
-Say, don't blame me. I'm
just a fella with a desk job.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:53.686
-[ Spits ]

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.554
-Well, now, that's a punch line.

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:59.692
-Emphasis on the "punch."

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.459
[ Crackling ]

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:01.627
-[ Distorted ] Jimmy.

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:04.263
Who's doing this to you, Jimmy?

00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:06.132
-Gee, did you hear that?

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.100
-I--I -- I don't -- no.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.035
No, I don't hear a thing.

00:01:10.035 --> 00:01:11.204
[ Feedback crackles ]

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:20.613 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.181
Good evening, I'm Jimmy Fallon

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:25.284
broadcasting live in color
from Rock Center.

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:27.486
Tonight, my guest is
a far-out young artist.

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:29.989
Please welcome Elizabeth Olsen.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:30.990
[ Applause ]

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.692
-Excited to be here.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:34.193
-I'm glad you swung by.

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.529
And I'm glad you brought
your own cigarette.

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:37.730
-Oh, sure, yeah.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.532
This is a....

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:40.966
cigarette.

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:42.368
[ Audience laughs ]

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.536
-Now, you're giving us the
lowdown on your new film,

00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:47.173
titled "Stop Dipping Your Toes
In My Kool-Aid:

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.575
Tales from the Mind Palace."

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:52.879
-We're really sticking it
to the man with this one.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.347
-Well, as long as you're not
sticking this man

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:56.916
into a theater seat --

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.685
[ Audience laughs ]

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.821
-Hey --

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:03.322
Jimmy, why aren't we together?

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:04.924
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:06.993
-Well, I'm flattered,
but I'm already hitched.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.027
[ Audience awws ]

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.229
-No, no, no, no.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:10.763
I mean...

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:13.166
why aren't we in the same room?

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:16.869
Why are we in these --
these...boxes?

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.838
[ Hum growing ]

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.206
Jimmy...

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.208
we've got to get out of here.

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.542
-No.

00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:24.744
[ Feedback crackles ]

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:33.752 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:33.752 --> 00:02:35.355
We back?

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:36.455
Cool.

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:38.458
We're here with
a crazy-talented actress,

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:41.427
You know her, you love her.
Lizzie Olsen, guys!

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.428
[ Applause ]

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.730
Uh, Liz?

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.531
Need a chill pill?

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:47.666
-[ Scoffs ] As if.

00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:48.700
[ Audience laughs ]

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.604
I just needed a sec to...

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.939
Wait.

00:02:53.939 --> 00:02:55.341
Who's laughing?

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.843
-Uh, Tipper Gore?
Who do you think?

00:02:57.843 --> 00:02:58.844
[ Audience laughs ]

00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:02.515
-No, seriously, who's laughing?

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:06.986
Jimmy, you don't
have an audience.

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:08.454
Are you doing all of this?

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.022
Is this because you want things
to be back to normal, right?

00:03:10.022 --> 00:03:11.791
Like before the pandemic?

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.792
No. No, don't --

00:03:13.792 --> 00:03:15.227
[ Feedback crackles ]

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:25.204 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:26.439
-Welcome back, guys!

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:28.441
I'm here with Elizabeth Olsen.

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:29.775
Uh...

00:03:29.775 --> 00:03:31.143
You good, bud?

00:03:31.143 --> 00:03:34.146
-Jimmy, you have to stop.

00:03:34.146 --> 00:03:37.717
I know the present is scary and
we all want COVID to be over,

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:41.654
but you can't just run
from your problems.

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:44.023
-You know that's --
that's a great point.

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:46.726
Anyway, it's time to
Lick It for 10!

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.360
-Jimmy, snap out of it, okay?

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.529
This isn't reality.

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:52.365
I know you're trying to cope.

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:53.633
I know that.

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:57.036
But you can't keep
controlling all of this.

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.071
-I--I'm not
controlling all of --

00:03:59.071 --> 00:04:00.406
-Jimmy.
[ Sad music playing ]

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:02.174
Look at me.

00:04:02.174 --> 00:04:03.876
It's okay.

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:05.878
It's okay.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.181
You can let go.

00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:10.817
Jimmy.

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:14.119
Let...go.

00:04:14.119 --> 00:04:15.054
[ Feedback crackles ]

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:20.760 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:26.432 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.834
-Hey, guys! Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:32.572
I'm here via Zoom with the one
and only Elizabeth Olsen.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:34.039
-Hi, Jimmy.

00:04:34.039 --> 00:04:36.075
Are you ready to do this?

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:38.344
-I think I am.

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:40.012
Now, everyone's
going crazy for this.

00:04:40.012 --> 00:04:42.547
You've got to tell me about
your new show "WandaVision."

00:04:42.547 --> 00:04:43.616
[ Feedback crackles ]

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:46.252
-Wait, it's -- it's still --

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:49.755
But if it wasn't you,
then who was it?

00:04:49.755 --> 00:04:53.092
-Ohh, poor Elizabeth.

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:56.696
-Wait, Kathryn Hahn.
What are you doing here?

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:57.930
-What can I say?

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.000
TV just isn't
what it used to be.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.534
[ Audience laughs ]

00:05:02.534 --> 00:05:05.504
-♪ Who's been messing up
everything? ♪

00:05:05.504 --> 00:05:09.508
-♪ It's been Kathryn Hahn
all along ♪

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:12.045 line:0%
♪♪

